# game/
# The target ROM and its battery save, kept out of version control.
#
# Expected contents (gitignored — not committed):
#   trm-yum6.gba   base ROM (Yu-Gi-Oh! Ultimate Masters / WC06), 32 MB,
#                  clean CRC32 0xF968A196
#   trm-yum6.sav   in-game SRAM save (profile, decks, progress)
#   *.zip          original archive the ROM was extracted from
#
# Place a clean trm-yum6.gba here to run the tools and build the patch.
